From fb344b8d12b56937977172ce2026994737049db0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vivek Das Mohapatra <vivek@collabora.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Jan 2026 23:12:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] libdiscover/HoloBackend: Make the OS name track
 /etc/os-release

We want the Holo backend to work both for the planned generic Holo
base OS and branded/device-targeted variants like SteamOS.

Since /etc/os-release is the canonical source of this information
the discover backend should treat it as authoritative for the OS name.
